      "content": "i get both sides, but it's hard to tell which one is actually more realistic. like, if we look at the actual data on market concentration and how these platforms control so much of the info we see, doesn't that make the \"consumer benefits\" argument feel a bit weak? it almost feels like the innovation argument is just a way to avoid accountability for how much power they actually hold.",
